The dashboard provides interactive insights into real estate property pricing.

Key Performance Indicators
Total Properties
Average Property Price
Highest Property Price
Lowest Property Price
Total Sales
Average Square Footage


📈 Dashboard Visualizations
1. Average Property Price by Neighborhood

A bar chart that compares average property prices across different neighborhoods.

Business Value:
Helps stakeholders identify high-value and affordable locations.

2. Property Price vs Square Footage

A scatter chart that analyzes the relationship between property size and price.

Business Value:
Helps understand whether larger properties generally have higher prices.

3. School Proximity Analysis

A chart comparing property prices based on their distance from schools.

Business Value:
Helps determine whether properties closer to schools have higher values.

4. Interactive Property Map

A map visualization displaying property locations using:

Latitude
Longitude
Property Price
Neighborhood

Business Value:
Allows stakeholders to explore geographical property pricing patterns.

5. Property Type Analysis

A chart comparing:

Apartments
Villas
Independent Houses
Other Property Types

Business Value:
Identifies which property categories have higher average prices.
